        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Electricity mix, medium voltage, GO cancellations
This dataset describes the transformation from high to medium voltage as well as the transmission of electricity at medium voltage.\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Elektrizität\nLocal subcategory: Erzeugungsmix\nUVEK 2022 source file:726-Strommixe-EU_v0.8._X-GO cancellations Distribution.xml\n\n
UUID: 978c4a5c-1cc9-36c7-9add-246ddd8f70d5
Included are the electricity production in HU, the transmission network and direct SF6-emissions to air. Electricity losses during medium-voltage transmission and transformation from high-voltage are accounted for.
Location: undefined
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_978c4a5c-1cc9-36c7-9add-246ddd8f70d5.xml</text>
